A span across bodies keeps their header semantics

```
{body-rows=2,1 body-header-rows=0,1 body-header-cols=1,0}
| a | b |
| ^ | c |
| ^ | D |
| e | f |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row" rowspan="3">a</th><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="col">D</th></tr>
    <tr><td>e</td><td>f</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
